  "schema:name": "Russ Kramer at Coffee Sun Drying Bed, Sidamo Province, Ethiopia",
  "schema:description": "This image shows Russ Kramer, president of Hacienda La Minita, standing over green coffee dried on raised beds in Sidamo Province, Ethiopia. Hacienda La Minita serves as Distant Lands Coffee’s green coffee trading division, sourcing specialty coffee from countries such as Ethiopia. Coffee in Ethiopia is grown largely by smallholder farmers and processed at local cooperatives and washing stations.",
